\n    mps = time_increment // 60\n    var_step = var_min[: n_steps * mps].reshape(n_steps, mps).sum(axis=1)\n    sig = np.sqrt(var_step)\n\n    nu = P(\"NU\", 5.0)\n    eta = P(\"ETA\", 0.2)\n    z = rng.standard_t(nu, size=(num_simulations, n_steps)) * np.sqrt((nu - 2) / nu)\n    m = np.exp(eta * rng.standard_normal((num_simulations, 1)) - eta**2)\n    inc = z * sig[None, :] * m\n    inc -= 0.5 * (sig[None, :] * m) ** 2\n    logp = np.concatenate([np.zeros((num_simulations, 1)), np.cumsum(inc, axis=1)], axis=1)\n    paths = last * np.exp(logp)\n    return (start_time, time_increment, *paths)\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":31,"newStart":1,"newLines":100,"lines":["-\"\"\"Starter model written by the harness: log-normal martingale calibrated on the context.","+\"\"\"Seasonal EWMA-volatility price simulator for Synth SN50 (CRYPTO_24H, COM_EQU_24H, CRYPTO_1H)."," ","-This is a deliberately simple STARTING POINT — replace it with your own model.","-Contract: simulate(...) -> (start_timestamp, time_increment, *paths), each path has","-time_length//time_increment + 1 points starting at the context's last price.","+Per-minute variance = weekly profile (NY local time, fitted offline, agent/artifacts) x deseasonalised","+level. The level is forecast from two gap-aware EWMAs of the context's squared returns, the short one","+decaying into the long one over the horizon. Paths: Student-t increments, a per-path volatility","+multiplier (vol-of-vol), martingale in price."," \"\"\""," "," from __future__ import annotations"," ","+import json","+import os","+from functools import lru_cache","+from pathlib import Path","+"," import numpy as np","+import pandas as pd"," ","+ART = Path(__file__).resolve().parent / \"artifacts\"","+SEASON_FILE = os.environ.get(\"SEASON_FILE\", \"season.json\")"," ","-def simulate(","-    asset: str,","-    start_time,","-    time_increment: int = 300,","-    time_length: int = 86_400,","-    num_simulations: int = 1000,","-    context_pr